_build/
_opam/
*.install
.merlin
.DS_Store

# Generated by `mirage configure` in mirage-smoke/ (see mirage-smoke/README.md).
# Their presence breaks a plain `dune build` at the root, which is why the
# unikernel check is a separate flow that ends in `mirage clean`.
# ...and at the repo root, if `mirage configure -f mirage-smoke/config.ml` is
# ever run from here rather than through test/check-unikernel.sh.
/Makefile
/dune-workspace
mirage-smoke/Makefile
mirage-smoke/dune
mirage-smoke/dune.build
mirage-smoke/dune.config
mirage-smoke/dune-project
mirage-smoke/dune-workspace*
mirage-smoke/main.ml
mirage-smoke/mirage/
mirage-smoke/dist/
mirage-smoke/*.opam
mirage-smoke/.mirage.config
